## Access

`<body data-floqr-feature="botDee">` — off / not granted → not-available card + Back. Satellite session shell. Chat callable requires signed-in + feature gate.

**hasUsedBotDee (0\|1, not boolean)** lives on `botDeeThreads/{uid}` (Functions-write). 0 = never used (first-time Settings auto-open). 1 = has used, written after the first successful send. Every BOT DEE entry checks it before serving: `getBotDeeAccess` / `getBotDeeThread` / `getBotDeeConsent` / `executeBotSession`, plus client `FLOQRBotDeeAccess.requireUsage` on `guardPage`. Fail-closed → 0. `botdee-photo-popout.html` is public (no gate).

