## Conversation personalization (s3.3.023)

Versioned first-use (`personalization.botDeePersonalizationVersion`, current **2**). First visit opens the **setup overlay** on `botdee.html` (`#botDeePersonalizationDialog`) — name, demeanor, recap, Save & Close. There is **no** standing Settings button under the composer. Later edits live in **Profile & Settings → Feature & Orders → My BOT DEE**. Chat reset is **one-shot** (`botDeeSessionResetVersion`): old turns stay hidden until the generation is stamped; skipping the overlay and chatting must not wipe later turns. Composer capture **never** treats greetings / `help` / `privacy` as a name. Guest prefs reload from `localStorage`; signed-in prefs persist on `botDeeThreads/{uid}`. Recap default on. Never list ShoutOut / VIP / floqCast as a greeting dump; real answers may name products. Pause status: **Session paused. Continue chatting.** Idle 300s. Functions deploy required for save + session reset.

## Durable resume (s3.3.006)

Signed-in chat lives in `botDeeThreads/{uid}` (one thread per uid). Refresh or a second device calls `getBotDeeThread` and paints the last 12 turns while inside the conversation pause (`conversationIdleSeconds`; Master Admin; packaged default 300 / 5 minutes). Pause / farewell starts a new epoch. Flag `durableThreads` defaults **on**; set `0` on `botDeeSettings/default` to roll back. Functions deploy required — Pages-only does not persist.

## Six-phase upgrade (spec v1.2)

Order **1 → 2 → 3 → 5 → 4 → 6**. Upgrade, never rebuild. Brand **BOT DEE**. Idle 300s still ends the **active** session; opt-in archive is separate (default off). Guests stay ephemeral. Mingl is never copied into BOT DEE memory. SmartViews are mock until legal evidence. Venue cards open `club-profile.html?location=` (no `?v=`). Patron Public Web Research is off. No second profile-visibility toggle. Capability manifest never claims deploy. No LangChain / Redis / SQL. No stored IP. Functions stay PR-only until the owner approves deploy.

## Owner action

BOT DEE stays gated until Master Admin → Features & Services sets **botDee** Live/Test (UI label **BOT DEE**). `seedFeatureServices` copies flags from legacy `featureServices/floqAi` when creating `botDee`. Deploy Functions when callables / classification change. Six-phase legal gates: Master Admin records provider evidence before any live adapter.

Tests: `functions/botdee-page.test.js`, `functions/bot-dee-core.test.js`, `functions/botdee-help-access.test.js`, `functions/botdee-upgrade.test.js`.
